{"id":"7005c5e9ddc38c06","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness.md","title":"R归结及因子化的模型可靠性","display":"thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness — R归结及因子化的模型可靠性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness","aliases":["72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness"],"display":"thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness — R归结及因子化的模型可靠性","depends_on":["[[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]]","[[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.6.2 print61/PDF73; full local model proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness — R归结及因子化的模型可靠性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb7ab4318ec98937\" href=\"?note=bb7ab4318ec98937\" title=\"72-df-first-order-r-resolution\">72-df-first-order-r-resolution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dd527eaf83c7e032\" href=\"?note=dd527eaf83c7e032\" title=\"72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution\">72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.6.2 print61/PDF73; full local model proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\">\\(\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\">\\(B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}C\\land\\operatorname{Factor}(C,\\theta,D)\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}D.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}C\\land\\operatorname{Factor}(C,\\theta,D)\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}D.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}B\\land\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}C\\land\\operatorname{RRes}(B,C,D)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}D.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}B\\land\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}C\\land\\operatorname{RRes}(B,C,D)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}D.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>因子化是整条子句实例，直接用实例引理。对R步，实例引理先给Bθ与(Cρ)θ在每个赋值下真。若D在某赋值下假，则两个父实例中除被删枢轴外所有文字都假，因此前者迫使Aθ真，后者迫使其经典否定真，矛盾。标准化分离和最一般性用于源规则的精确规格及完备性论证，当前可靠性证明对更一般的两条实例同样成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-first-order-r-resolution","status":"resolved","id":"bb7ab4318ec98937","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"dd527eaf83c7e032","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)","display":false},{"tex":"B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}C\\land\\operatorname{Factor}(C,\\theta,D)\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}D.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}B\\land\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}C\\land\\operatorname{RRes}(B,C,D)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}D.","display":true}],"bytes":1668,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property]] · [[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]] · [[72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness]] · [[72-thm-propositional-compactness]] · [[72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-34","location